5ceabd788d2e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Across all regimes, the as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"t", "->", "\[Infinity]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "f9812b00-a699-4ab9-a32a-5839d5f82a38"],
 ", memory of the initial state is erased and the system relaxes to the \
stationary thermal state:"
