   4.00111640216054*^9, 
   4.001116441799747*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"858f9189-4b4d-40ad-8b16-\
35fdd2a4e5f6"],

Cell["Structural and computational advantages:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001116643283967*^9, 
  4.0011166618518763`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"27d33d20-d26e-43e0-81a7-\
b0a241451c8e"],

Cell["\<\
The algebraic mapping from \[CapitalDelta]\[CapitalSigma](0) to \
\[CapitalSigma](t) is identical across the underdamped, overdamped and \
critically damped branches.  Only the scalar elements of the Greens function \
change.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001116669708453*^9, 
  4.001116743092394*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f0d336a9-cce0-43d4-8506-\
f44380c13c85"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If the initial wavepacket is prepared in the thermal equilibrium state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
       StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]}]], "(", "0", ")"}], "=", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "cb872031-0e86-4801-bdfa-97ee02a115b1"],
 ", the transient term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["G",
      FontWeight->"Bold",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", "t", ")"}], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
       StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
        FontWeight->"Bold"]}]], "(", "0", ")"}], 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["G",
       FontWeight->"Bold",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "T"], "(", "t", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.999605314791943*^9, 3.999605412640051*^9}, {
    3.9996054740412197`*^9, 3.999605566473194*^9}, {4.000421938323202*^9, 
    4.00042195783239*^9}, {4.0004222272255993`*^9, 4.000422355929029*^9}, {
    4.001087951363468*^9, 4.001088000874812*^9}, {4.0010880631173162`*^9, 
    4.001088097510171*^9}, {4.001088621856681*^9, 4.0010886653871727`*^9}, {
    4.001089379522028*^9, 4.001089407124345*^9}, {4.001091166130054*^9, 
    4.0010912129902554`*^9}, 4.001091391261121*^9, {4.001091486974721*^9, 
    4.0010915026822567`*^9}, {4.001095559611475*^9, 4.001095579289102*^9}, {
    4.0010957252885227`*^9, 4.001095806261395*^9}, {4.001095966832601*^9, 
    4.001095974883708*^9}, {4.001096095231681*^9, 4.001096125714559*^9}, {
    4.001096232966847*^9, 4.001096290364564*^9}, {4.0010963325687428`*^9, 
    4.001096352430357*^9}, {4.0011114935177526`*^9, 4.001111551729865*^9}, {
    4.0011115951743097`*^9, 4.001111787687873*^9}, {4.001113968024612*^9, 
    4.001114012974532*^9}, {4.00111406161021*^9, 4.0011141656592827`*^9}, {
    4.001114333952326*^9, 4.00111439131503*^9}, {4.00111455441544*^9, 
    4.0011145603936996`*^9}, {4.001114696932131*^9, 4.001114699523469*^9}, {
    4.0011147930886183`*^9, 4.001114803971299*^9}, {4.001114922662426*^9, 
    4.001114961193822*^9}, {4.001115773914569*^9, 4.0011158993165607`*^9}, {
    4.001115951398769*^9, 4.0011160112638197`*^9}, {4.0011160533271437`*^9, 
    4.0011160753910303`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "92808978-2424-47e0-98cb-81699badf1b7"],
 " vanishes identically for all ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["t", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9300fa25-0e91-4fc9-a612-ac384a52f755"],
 ", leaving the covariance matrix stationary even if the classical center is \
displaced from the origin and undergoing damped oscillations."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001116751414852*^9, 
  4.001116899382903*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5aaf0cfa-2daf-4fc9-879c-\
112e9a29acd4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For an ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["N", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "4e3e58d9-ee38-4767-b91d-ef46a8e6f8d9"],
 "-dimensional coupled oscillator system, the Greens function matrix and \
covariance matrix generalize immediately to 2Nx2N phase-space matrices \
without altering the governing equation."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0011169236604357`*^9, 
  4.00111698652034*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9b11f3b8-5667-4088-bc6b-\
e133cdaa70a1"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Green\[CloseCurlyQuote]s function approach to CL for the free particle \
", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0011427227485247`*^9, 
  4.001142745395527*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5673d7ce-0706-494a-994d-\
bf599adbd9d2"],

Cell["\<\
For the dissipative free particle, there is no confining potential to create \
a stationary spatial equilibrium--instead, the spatial variance grows \
indefinitely via Einstein diffusion.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0011427564027576`*^9, 
  4.001142828043351*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"324ff1ec-76dc-45ec-bd3f-\
393e16909d6d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "\[Infinity]", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dae0702-9023-4656-bebe-a36e0639f7d1"],
 " does not exist as a finite constant matrix, the general variation of the \
parameters formula writes ",
 StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "(t) as the homogeneous Green\[CloseCurlyQuote]s matrix propagation of the \
initial state plus a time-dependent thermal noise matrix accumulated from the \
bath"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001142830708682*^9, 
  4.001142901028091*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9dded228-470b-43ae-ab0e-\
bdb0dba02f82"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "t", ")"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["G",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "t", ")"}], 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "0", ")"}], 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["G",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "T"], "(", "t", ")"}]}], "+", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["N",
      FontWeight->"Bold",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", "t", ")"}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.999605314791943*^9, 3.999605412640051*^9}, {
   3.9996054740412197`*^9, 3.999605566473194*^9}, {4.000421938323202*^9, 
   4.00042195783239*^9}, {4.0004222272255993`*^9, 4.000422355929029*^9}, {
   4.001087951363468*^9, 4.001088000874812*^9}, {4.0010880631173162`*^9, 
   4.001088097510171*^9}, {4.001088621856681*^9, 4.0010886653871727`*^9}, {
   4.001089379522028*^9, 4.001089407124345*^9}, {4.001091166130054*^9, 
   4.0010912129902554`*^9}, 4.001091391261121*^9, {4.001091486974721*^9, 
   4.0010915026822567`*^9}, {4.001095559611475*^9, 4.001095579289102*^9}, {
   4.0010957252885227`*^9, 4.001095806261395*^9}, {4.001095966832601*^9, 
   4.001095974883708*^9}, {4.001096095231681*^9, 4.001096125714559*^9}, {
   4.001096232966847*^9, 4.001096290364564*^9}, {4.0010963325687428`*^9, 
   4.001096352430357*^9}, {4.0011114935177526`*^9, 4.001111551729865*^9}, {
   4.0011115951743097`*^9, 4.001111787687873*^9}, {4.001113968024612*^9, 
   4.001114012974532*^9}, {4.001142919785108*^9, 
   4.0011429390325336`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e53e7812-1b67-43db-9c61-\
9ad9935ca503"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For comparison, for the harmonic oscillator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["N",
      FontWeight->"Bold",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", "t", ")"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "\[Infinity]", ")"}], "-", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["G",
        FontWeight->"Bold",
        FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", "t", ")"}], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "\[Infinity]", ")"}], 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["G",
         FontWeight->"Bold",
         FontSlant->"Plain"], "T"], "(", "t", ")"}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "3f44e55b-ad2d-407b-b335-f992d4177797"],
 ".  This leads to the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
      StyleBox["\[CapitalSigma]",
       FontWeight->"Bold"]}]], "(", "0", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "f63efa60-4105-49ef-b5c0-66aec6b7a8eb"],
 " that we had in the previous section."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.00114299520361*^9, 4.001143040937422*^9}, {
  4.00114308329738*^9, 
  4.0011431199555073`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dfd87ed5-452f-4dbe-8278-\
3eae64901396"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We can take the harmonic oscillator result for the trajectory solution and \
simply set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Omega]", "->", "0"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "cd4ead92-f4f0-46ba-8142-d4bd39097802"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001143147229375*^9, 
  4.001143201360865*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9b26d089-ab28-46fc-8ad2-\
e38fa9ebb135"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
      {
       SubscriptBox["x", "t"]},
      {
       SubscriptBox["p", "t"]}
     }], ")"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["G",
       FontWeight->"Bold",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", "t", ")"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
        {
         SubscriptBox["x", "0"]},
        {
         SubscriptBox["p", "0"]}
       }], ")"}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
        {"1", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"1", "-", 
           SuperscriptBox["\[ExponentialE]", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", 
