Cell["\<\
There are different ways to derive the mechanical power and the heat bath \
flux.  We will proceed by differentiating the trace expression.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001595590454104*^9, 
  4.001595663052718*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b3585300-8ad6-4979-893a-\
2cfe7efd573a"],

Cell["\<\
Differentiating this with respect to time via the product rule separates the \
rate of energy change into two physically distinct fluxes\
\>", "Text",
