Cell["\<\
where the three terms correspond to a spatially uniform baseline shift, the \
dipole work rate performed on the classical wavepacket\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
center, and the parametric squeezing work rate performed by modulating the \
trap curvature.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001575503645091*^9, 
  4.0015755709538527`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3223c441-2e3e-4b14-b967-\
