Cell["\<\
Using the fundamental theorem of calculus and the normalization condition on \
the density (which requires both the density  and its derivative to vanish \
asymptotically), we find that the left hand side must vanish\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001587574116385*^9, 4.001587626629014*^9}, {
  4.001587694434116*^9, 4.001587706239065*^9}, {4.00158806037554*^9, 
